Author:     William Godbe <wigodbe@microsoft.com>
AuthorDate: Wed Oct 7 09:07:54 2026 -0700
Commit:     GitHub <noreply@github.com>
CommitDate: Wed Oct 7 09:07:54 2026 -0700

    Replace custom reference resolution with explicit references and CPM (#69631)
    
    * Convert reference declarations mechanically
    
    Convert assembly-name references to explicit project/package references, centralize ordinary version declarations, root repository project paths, and separate reference blocks with blank lines.
    
    This mechanical-only file set is paired with the following build-infrastructure commit.
    
    Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
    
    * Replace custom reference resolution with central package management
    
    Introduce the central package catalog and explicit reference inventories while preserving framework, packaging, tool, and standalone-consumer behavior. Update generation and validation, retain intentional version overrides, and fix consumer, linker, WebView, and SiteExtension integration.
    
    Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
    
    ---------
    
    Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

